    <string name="joint_how">The phone starts measuring and invites the watch. On the watch: tap the \"Joint run\" notice, wait for the blue GPS ready, and press Start. At the end, on the watch: swipe the run screen up and hold \"Hold to finish\". The phone stops by itself. Keep the phone on you, in a hand or a tight pocket.</string>
